  System.pl_mpeg.C.adam - pl_mpeg's C API (Dominic Szablewski, MIT, commit
  c871f2be022e: an MPEG-1 video / MP2 audio decoder and MPEG-PS demuxer),
  written by `adam cimport` from the headers libpl_mpeg.a is built with
  (res/libs/vendor/include/pl_mpeg) with their own names: every routine
  `external "pl_mpeg"` (libpl_mpeg.a in res/libs/vendor/<triple>, built by
  AdamLang-Libs; its LICENSE in res/libs/vendor/licenses/pl_mpeg), records
  laid out as C lays them out, the constant macros as typed consts.
  AdamLang-Libs' additions: plm_create_with_filename_utf8 (a UTF-8 path on
  every target, 64-bit offsets) and plm_create_with_stream (any source of
  bytes through two callbacks, plm_stream_t). Do not edit: a change belongs
  in the spec, res/cimport/System.pl_mpeg.C.cimport.toml, then regenerate.
